              "diagrama_mermaid": "graph TD\n  E[Entidad #42] --> C1[PositionComponent x, y]\n  E --> C2[VelocityComponent dx, dy]\n  E --> C3[HealthComponent hp]\n  S1[MovementSystem] --> C1\n  S1 --> C2\n  S2[CombatSystem] --> C3"
